  Workflow objective: User requested a new workflow for: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Desired outcome: Deliver an abstract workflow plan that satisfies: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Workflow summary: Abstract workflow plan for receiving emails and classifying them by urgency level (bajo, medio, alto, crítico) using AI, with no additional notifications. The classified data will be stored in a designated system for silent internal use.
  Current stage id: stage_3
  Current stage name: Store Classified Emails
  Stage purpose: Save the classified emails with their urgency labels to a designated storage system.
  Stage required capabilities: Write structured data (emails with urgency labels) to a persistent storage system.
  Stage expected inputs: Enriched email data from Stage 2 (content, sender, subject, timestamp, attachments, urgency).
  Stage expected outputs: Acknowledgment of successful storage or error handling for failed writes.
  Stage dependencies: stage_2
  Previous stage node selections: stage_1: n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap | stage_2: n8n-nodes-base.aiTransform
  Clarifications already provided:
  -
  Retrieval focus hint: Find the best standard n8n nodes for this stage.
