ssential planning information is missing, set planning_ready=false and list the missing_information as concise user-facing clarification questions.\n- Write missing_information questions in the same language as the user's request.\n- handoff_notes must explain what architect_agent should preserve when grounding this plan into nodes.\n", "role": "user"}], "model": "local-model", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.2}, "request_id": "4c85d22f30", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "total_chars": 6070, "ts_utc": "2026-03-20T14:46:18.002351+00:00"}
