 output one of the five labels (low, medium, high, critical, review) based on confidence thresholds.\n\n**Next-Stage Connectivity**: The annotated emails can proceed directly to stages that apply visible labels or perform further processing without breaking workflow coherence.", "request_id": "7cad4ecddd", "selected_candidates": [{"display_name": "OpenAI", "evidence_refs": ["https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-langchain.openai/"], "has_main_input": true, "input_connection_types": ["main"], "limitations": [], "link_confidence": 1.0, "node_type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi", "output_connection_types": ["main"], "rejected_reasons": [], "rerank_confidence": null, "type_version": 1, "usable_as_tool": false, "usage_mode": "action_only"}], "selected_node_types": ["n8n-nodes-base.openAi"], "stage": "multi_agent.architect.stage_selection", "stage_id": "stage_classify_urgency", "ts_utc": "2026-03-20T15:03:53.570800+00:00"}
